#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "AI Advisor created a recommendation. Review the validated plan before Apply."
msgstr "AI 어드바이저가 권장 사항을 생성했습니다. 적용하기 전에 검증된 계획을 검토하세요."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"AI-assisted Apply is blocked until a clean current-version Runtime "
"Acceptance exists."
msgstr "현재 버전의 런타임 승인 검사가 정상으로 확인될 때까지 AI 지원 적용이 차단됩니다."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "AI-assisted Apply was blocked safely."
msgstr "AI 지원 설정 적용이 안전하게 차단되었습니다."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "AI-assisted configuration, human-approved"
msgstr "AI 지원 설정 · 사용자 승인 필수"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "AI-assisted performance plan was accepted after Runtime Acceptance."
msgstr "런타임 승인 검사 후 AI 지원 성능 계획이 승인되었습니다."

#: includes/class-yperf-recommendations.php
msgid "AI-ready evidence"
msgstr "AI 분석용 근거"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "AI-ready · local"
msgstr "AI 분석 준비 완료 · 로컬"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "ATTENTION"
msgstr "주의"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
